{"unit_id":"julensun-ir__DSH-RESTART-TOOL#card-zh","repo":"julensun-ir/DSH-RESTART-TOOL","commit":"0fc8d50edf469c1141e2d9a0fc1e8706e74b7ee1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-restart-tool 是面向 DSH Web 的重启与关机插件，可供 agent 调用模型工具，也可通过侧边栏电源控制操作。它注册重启和关机工具，并提供本机 HTTP 状态接口；重启时由 helper 等待端口释放、重新启动原服务并确认新实例响应。插件还显示在线状态、在重启后自动刷新页面，并可记录运行中的会话、恢复后发送继续提示。看门狗可选启用，用于检测服务中断并尝试重新启动；适合需要从 DSH 会话内管理 Web 服务的用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:443-480"]}
{"unit_id":"julensun-ir__DSH-RESTART-TOOL#card-en","repo":"julensun-ir/DSH-RESTART-TOOL","commit":"0fc8d50edf469c1141e2d9a0fc1e8706e74b7ee1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-restart-tool adds agent tools and sidebar controls to restart or shut down a DSH web host. A helper relaunches the host and checks its response. The sidebar shows service health and reloads after restart. Active sessions can receive a continue prompt, with an optional watchdog for host recovery.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:443-480"]}
